{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.7, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.10, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.4"
  description: "`safe_typed` restates `w`'s default as `Content-Type` over `typed_by<safe_header>`, so the default is a value of the enum, matched in its label type's folding form to the member written `content-type`: the schema loads and the omitted field takes the default."
